Loading

Refreshing

Empty

Partial Data

Success

Validation Error

API Error

Offline

Retry

Cancelled

Expired

Completed

---

# Decision Points

Every branching path must define:

Condition

Destination

Fallback

Recovery

Analytics Event

Example:

User has active gym membership?

YES

↓

Show Membership Dashboard

NO

↓

Show Join Gym Flow

---

# Data Persistence

During every flow:

Drafts are auto-saved.

User progress is preserved.

Interrupted flows resume automatically.

No data is lost unexpectedly.

---

# AI Integration Rules

The AI Coach may enter any flow when appropriate.

