# Performance Standards

Screen transition:

<200 ms

API feedback:

<2 s

Skeleton loading:

Immediately

Animations:

60 FPS

---

# Flow Completion Rules

Every completed flow should:

Celebrate success.

Save progress.

Sync analytics.

Update dashboard.

Refresh widgets.

Generate recommendations.

Offer the next best action.

---

# Error Recovery

No dead ends.

Every error must provide:

What happened

Why it happened (when appropriate)

Recovery action

Retry option

Support option

---

# UX Metrics

Track:

Flow Completion Rate

Abandonment Rate

Average Completion Time

Tap Count

Back Navigation Count

Error Frequency

Retry Frequency

Success Rate

---

# Product Principles

Users should never feel lost.

Users should never repeat unnecessary work.

Every interaction should build confidence.

Every completed task should encourage the next healthy action.

